  Freeze: "Freeze: a frozen minion can't attack on its controller's next turn.",
  Toxic: "Toxic: takes 2 damage at the start of its controller's turn, every turn, until it dies.",
  ToxicTouch: "Toxic Touch: any minion it fights becomes Toxic.",
  Merchant: "Merchant: when played, choose 1 of several offered cards to add to your hand.",
  Deathtouch: "Deathtouch: any minion it damages in combat is destroyed instantly.",
  Battlecry: "Entrance: triggers once, the moment you play this card from your hand.",
